{"words": [{"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Then"}, {"text": "أَنتُمْ", "translation": "you"}, {"text": "هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ", "translation": "(are) those"}, {"text": "تَقْتُلُونَ", "translation": "(who) kill"}, {"text": "أَنفُسَكُمْ", "translation": "yourselves"}, {"text": "وَتُخْرِجُونَ", "translation": "and evict"}, {"text": "فَرِيقًۭا", "translation": "a party"}, {"text": "مِّنكُم", "translation": "of you"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "دِيَـٰرِهِمْ", "translation": "their homes"}, {"text": "تَظَـٰهَرُونَ", "translation": "you support one another"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِم", "translation": "against them"}, {"text": "بِٱلْإِثْمِ", "translation": "in sin"}, {"text": "وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ", "translation": "and [the] transgression"}, {"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "يَأْتُوكُمْ", "translation": "they come to you"}, {"text": "أُسَـٰرَىٰ", "translation": "(as) captives"}, {"text": "تُفَـٰدُوهُمْ", "translation": "you ransom them"}, {"text": "وَهُوَ", "translation": "while it"}, {"text": "مُحَرَّمٌ", "translation": "(was) forbidden"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "إِخْرَاجُهُمْ ۚ", "translation": "their eviction"}, {"text": "أَفَتُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "So do you believe"}, {"text": "بِبَعْضِ", "translation": "in part (of)"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "وَتَكْفُرُونَ", "translation": "and disbelieve"}, {"text": "بِبَعْضٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "in part"}, {"text": "فَمَا", "translation": "Then what"}, {"text": "جَزَآءُ", "translation": "(should be the) recompense"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "(for the one) who"}, {"text": "يَفْعَلُ", "translation": "does"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "خِزْىٌۭ", "translation": "disgrace"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ", "translation": "the life"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ", "translation": "(of) the world"}, {"text": "وَيَوْمَ", "translation": "and (on the) Day"}, {"text": "ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ", "translation": "of [the] Resurrection"}, {"text": "يُرَدُّونَ", "translation": "they will be sent back"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰٓ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "أَشَدِّ", "translation": "(the) most severe"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابِ ۗ", "translation": "punishment"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(is) Allah"}, {"text": "بِغَـٰفِلٍ", "translation": "unaware"}, {"text": "عَمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "you do"}], "sahih": "Then, you are those [same ones who are] killing one another and evicting a party of your people from their homes, cooperating against them in sin and aggression. And if they come to you as captives, you ransom them, although their eviction was forbidden to you. So do you believe in part of the Scripture and disbelieve in part? Then what is the recompense for those who do that among you except disgrace in worldly life; and on the Day of Resurrection they will be sent back to the severest of punishment. And Allāh is not unaware of what you do."}